{"v":1,"book":"Ps","ch":38,"verses":[{"n":0,"text":"A Psalm by David, for a memorial."},{"n":1,"text":"LORD, don’t rebuke me in your wrath, neither chasten me in your hot displeasure.","tok":[{"t":"LORD","s":["H3068"],"a":[0]},{"t":", don’t rebuke "},{"t":"me","s":["H2142"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"in","s":["H1732"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"your","s":["H2142"]},{"t":" wrath, neither chasten "},{"t":"me","s":["H2142"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"in","s":["H1732"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"your","s":["H2142"]},{"t":" hot displeasure."}]},{"n":2,"text":"For your arrows have pierced me, your hand presses hard on me.","tok":[{"t":"For","s":["H3068"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"your","s":["H3068"]},{"t":" arrows "},{"t":"have","s":["H3068"]},{"t":" pierced "},{"t":"me","s":["H3256"]},{"t":", "},{"t":"your","s":["H3068"]},{"t":" hand presses hard "},{"t":"on","s":["H3068"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"me","s":["H3256"]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":3,"text":"There is no soundness in my flesh because of your indignation, neither is there any health in my bones because of my sin.","tok":[{"t":"There "},{"t":"is","s":["H3027"]},{"t":" no soundness "},{"t":"in","s":["H5921"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"my","s":["H5921"]},{"t":" flesh "},{"t":"because","s":["H3588"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"of","s":["H3027"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"your","s":["H5921"]},{"t":" indignation, neither "},{"t":"is","s":["H3027"]},{"t":" there "},{"t":"any","s":["H3588"]},{"t":" health "},{"t":"in","s":["H5921"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"my","s":["H5921"]},{"t":" bones "},{"t":"because","s":["H3588"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"of","s":["H3027"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"my","s":["H5921"]},{"t":" sin."}]},{"n":4,"text":"For my iniquities have gone over my head. As a heavy burden, they are too heavy for me.","tok":[{"t":"For","s":["H6440"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"my","s":["H6440"]},{"t":" iniquities "},{"t":"have","s":["H7965"]},{"t":" gone "},{"t":"over","s":["H6440"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"my","s":["H6440"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"head","s":["H6440"]},{"t":". "},{"t":"As","s":["H6440"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"a","s":["H3068"]},{"t":" heavy burden, "}